# Binary assets: mark so git applies no text/EOL filters and treats them as
# non-diffable blobs. The woff2 font subset (M8-03) is the repo's first binary
# asset; per CLAUDE.md's source-byte-law carve-out (added in the same M8-03
# change) a path declared `binary` here is exempt from the printable-ASCII
# source-byte law and the per-artifact NUL/C0 scan. The scan still runs on every
# TEXT blob in the diff.
*.woff2 binary
